      "title": "Power traces force unipotence and control the conjugated distance to the identity",
      "statement": "The characteristic polynomial is (T−1)^n and (G−I)^n=0, including on the local components. At each real place the conjugated representative A satisfies ‖A−I‖_F≤δ=3√(nε). Also δ<1/4 and δqnf≤1/100 for q²≤n.",
